msgstr "Component"

#: ../../introduction/meeting_record_plugin.rst:156
msgid "Роль"
msgstr "Role"

#: ../../introduction/meeting_record_plugin.rst:157
msgid "``citeck-ai``"
msgstr "``citeck-ai``"

#: ../../introduction/meeting_record_plugin.rst:158
msgid ""
"Бэкенд: WebSocket-обработчик, pipeline STT → LLM summary → сохранение "
"активности"
msgstr ""
"Backend: WebSocket handler, pipeline STT → LLM summary → activity saving"

#: ../../introduction/meeting_record_plugin.rst:159
msgid "``citeck-stt-sidecar``"
msgstr "``citeck-stt-sidecar``"

#: ../../introduction/meeting_record_plugin.rst:160
msgid "Сервис транскрипции на базе GigaAM (распознавание русской речи)"
msgstr "Transcription service based on GigaAM (Russian speech recognition)"

#: ../../introduction/meeting_record_plugin.rst:161
msgid "nginx"
msgstr "nginx"

#: ../../introduction/meeting_record_plugin.rst:162
msgid "WebSocket-прокси ``/gateway/ai/ws/`` напрямую на ``citeck-ai``"
msgstr "WebSocket proxy ``/gateway/ai/ws/`` directly to ``citeck-ai``"

#: ../../introduction/meeting_record_plugin.rst:166
msgid ""
"Основной gateway Citeck не проксирует WebSocket. Для работы расширения "
"необходимо настроить nginx-маршрут ``/gateway/ai/ws/`` напрямую на "
"``citeck-ai``."
msgstr ""
"The main Citeck gateway does not proxy WebSocket. For the extension to "
"work, you need to configure an nginx route ``/gateway/ai/ws/`` directly "
"to ``citeck-ai``."

